msgid "<p><b style=\"color: #d83b01;\">注意：</b>此面板 <b style=\"color: #d83b01;\">不会</b> 在进入战斗或更换阵容时实时自动刷新或同步显示。<br>这是个用于向数据库关联或添加 <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">角色特征</b> 的工具面板。<br>点击 <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">{scan_team}</b> 后点击 <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">关联或添加</b> 特征, 自动战斗时就会识别对应的角色。<br>如果不想管理 <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">角色特征</b>, 可以直接使用 <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">{fixed_team}</b> 功能。</p>"
msgstr "<p><b style=\"color: #d83b01;\">Note:</b> This panel <b style=\"color: #d83b01;\">does NOT</b> automatically refresh or synchronize in real-time when entering combat or changing lineup.<br>This is a tool panel for associating or adding <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">Character Features</b> to the database.<br>Click <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">{scan_team}</b> then click <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">Associate or Add</b> feature, and auto combat will recognize the corresponding characters.<br>If you do not want to manage <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">Character Features</b>, you can directly use <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">{fixed_team}</b>.</p>"

msgid "<p>用于配置并保存常用的 4 人队伍阵容与出招表, 修改后立即生效。<br>点击 <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">{apply_preset}</b> 可一键更新应用方案中各角色的出招表 (未选择出招表则保持原配置不变)。<br>开启 <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">{fixed_preset}</b> 后自动战斗将直接采用此阵容, 无需等待特征识别 (未录入特征的角色亦可直接战斗)。<br>点击 <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">{fill_scan}</b> 可将上方特征扫描识别出的队伍角色快速填入当前方案。</p>"
msgstr "<p>Configure and save common 4-character team lineups and combos, effective immediately upon modification.<br>Click <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">{apply_preset}</b> to update and apply each character's combo in this preset (unselected slots keep original configuration).<br>Enable <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">{fixed_preset}</b> to directly use this preset lineup in auto combat without waiting for feature recognition (characters without registered features can combat directly).<br>Click <b style=\"color: #0078d7;\">{fill_scan}</b> to quickly fill in the characters recognized from the feature scan above into the current preset.</p>"

